### 2. Sheet Structure
- [ ] Document standard payroll sheet columns
- [ ] Define calculation formulas
- [ ] Set up templates for recurring months

### 3. Calculations
- [ ] Basic salary calculations
- [ ] Deductions (if applicable)
- [ ] Bonuses/incentives (if applicable)
- [ ] Final payroll summary

### 4. Approval Workflow
- [ ] Define approval chain
- [ ] Set notifications
- [ ] Archive completed sheets

